# cyto genome exported from cell 4 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break gg : Biomass < 4000 : Convert gg @15
Light : 0 < 1984 : FormBond g g
Break gg : rg < r & rg < 975 & rb < 5000 : FormBond r b @13
Break rb : r < rb & r < 975 : FormBond r g @13
Break rg : rb < rg & rb < 975 : Contract @6
